    <item>
      <title>Fireside Chat with Lateriser: Fighting FPL Temptations and Controlling Emotions</title>
      <description>Walsh and LR chat about why they suck and also why they're going to win FPL. And both make sense.


  Check out The FPL Wire on Youtube: https://www.youtube.com/@TheFPLWireFantasyPremierLeague

  Lateriser on Twitter: https://x.com/lateriser12


Chapters:


  00:00:00 Walsh OKAYYYYYYYY and Intro

  00:02:39 League Upheaval, 10ish New Managers, and 9ish Teams in Europe

  00:05:57 Man United: More Goals for Bruno and Flexibility

  00:10:59 Don't Sleep on Mbeumo

  00:16:10 Semenyo: Could Play 90' Every Game and Be the Guy

  00:19:34 Wildcard GW3? Free Hit GW3? Avoid Haaland?

  00:25:52 Can Arsenal Defense Be Taken On?

  00:29:31 How to Do Well at This Game and Where Do We Fuck Up: This Time It Will Be Different

  00:41:58 What's the Meta This Year: Cheapish Attackers and 8th Attackers

  00:44:33 Szoboszlai and Wirtz and Liverpool (and Gibbs-White and More Boomo)

  00:51:04 £4.5 Million Defenders: Shaw (but Maguire Better), Rodon, and Hume

  01:01:56 Third Forward Situation: DCL and… Fulham?

  01:05:27 Wirtz Time: Yes

  01:11:28 Chelsea Time: Xabi, Palmer, Rogers, João Pedro, Palestra

  01:16:04 What Do You Think About Spurs Defense? Robertson, Van Hecke

  01:26:17 Early Chip Thoughts

  01:28:51 Early GK Thoughts

  01:30:10 Outro and Mug and The FPL Wire


FML FPL is supported by our Patrons at https://www.patreon.com/FMLFPL

