    <item>
      <title>Budget FPL Picks: How Many to Go For</title>
      <description>The most scattershot, vibey preseason pod of the bunch so far. There are simply far too many budget guys to thoroughly talk about all of them, so we jump around like psychos, guys here and guys there.

