      <title>Fireside Chat with Pras: A Pre-Mortem for the 2026/27 FPL Season</title>
      <description>Alon chats again with Pras, but this time it's more of a "pre-mortem" — discussing what we learned from last season and how to apply it to the upcoming one.


  Check out The FPL Wire on Youtube: https://www.youtube.com/@TheFPLWireFantasyPremierLeague

  Pras on Twitter: https://x.com/Pras_fpl

  Rob T Data Graphics: https://x.com/robtFPL

  And Solio FPL Analytics: https://fpl.solioanalytics.com/


Chapters:


  00:00:00 Intro and Greetings and Where to Find All of Pras' Stuff

  00:01:47 Starting with Pras' 2025/26 FPL Season: How Well Did He Play, and What Went Wrong and Right?

  00:06:25 Actionable Things We Can Do to Rectify Alon's Mistakes from Last Season, and Vice Versa for Pras

  00:11:11 What the Hell Do We Do with DefCon? Starting with Defenders

  00:18:37 Forwards Have It Rough in FPL These Days

  00:24:27 The Different Types of DefCon Midfielders and the Slots Where They Belong

  00:32:42 Judging a Transfer and Following Your Gut (or Not)

  00:44:59 Teams and Players Pras Is Higher On Than Most People vs. Teams and Players He's Lower On

