    <item>
      <title>Fireside Chat with Anthony Dabbundo</title>
      <description>Alon chats again with Anthony Dabbundo and they go group by group through the 2026 World Cup, picking out winners, dark horses, teams they like, teams they dislike, and potential Fantasy World Cup angles.


