    <item>
      <title>Post-mortem: Our 25/26 FPL Season Autopsy</title>
      <description>We’re not good FPL players and we’re not having fun, so something has gone very wrong. Let’s break it down.


  World Cup Fantasy is live! Join the FML FPL league here: https://play.fifa.com/fantasy/join-league/WQRK6PBA


  Or just use the code: WQRK6PBA

  We’re also running a discount from now until the start of the World Cup: 25% off your first month: https://www.patreon.com/1069944/join


  Alon will be on The FPL Last Resort post-mortem episode on Monday: https://www.youtube.com/@fpllastresort



Chapters:


