  00:05:38 The Forgotten GW1 Bandwagon: Reijnders and Future GW1 Punts

  00:16:10 The Timing of Holding Too Long or Too Short: Bad Process

  00:26:07 Are the DefCons in the Room with Us Now: Use Transfers on Midfielders and Forwards Instead

  00:51:08 Capping Palmer and Capping Gyok: Pay More Attention

