    <item>
      <title>Budget FPL Picks: Please Tell Me Why, Do We Build Castles in the Sky?</title>
      <description>The Budget tier of FPL players are what dreams are made of. Stackings ifs and telling each other stories is why we’re a Fantasy Premier League podcast and it’s a big part of the fun of the game. Shadows are meant to be chased. Let’s go together.

