    <item>
      <title>Midpriced FPL Picks: Not All Bait Is a Trap</title>
      <description>Midpriced FPL players all look like bait but sometimes they’re actually good. Sometimes the cheese is just… cheese? Fantasy Premier League gems are often not the budget picks but the midpriced picks who perform like premiums. How many of these guys can you fit around your premiums?

