    <item>
      <title>Ep. 413 - Fireside Chat with Dr. Bradley Rettler - Why We Make Bad Decisions</title>
      <description>Walsh and Brad dive deep into decision making, cognitive biases, and mistakes that we all make (and will make again) in this game called #FPL, and ways to improve on them.
Dr. Rettler teaches philosophy and critical thinking at the University of Wyoming. He’s published 14 papers mostly on metaphysics and philosophy of religion, and has a book coming out in a few months giving a philosophical case for bitcoin.
Check him out here: www.bradleyrettler.com and here: http://resistance.money/
—
Apple Pods: https://podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/fml-fpl/id1024068765?uo=4
Spotify: https://open.spotify.com/show/2Oa7VmE2pyimDEge90QOsF
All our links: https://linktr.ee/fmlfpl
#FMLFPL #FantasyPremierLeague
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
