        <![CDATA[<p>BIGGGG 2+ hour episode!</p>
<p><br></p>
<p>We talk about #FPL macro and stuff from this season and stuff for next season and a little lifestyle action up until Walsh’s airpods die and we end the episode lol.</p>
<p><br></p>
<p>On Monday for Patreon subscribers only we’ll do the rest of the questions and whatever else and that’ll truly be the last episode of the season.</p>
<p><br></p>
<p>Thank you all for listening and the support!!!!!!!!</p>
