      <itunes:subtitle>&lt;p&gt;Carl Anka covers Manchester United for The Athletic and he also co-wrote "You Are A Champion: Unlock Your Potential, Find Your Voice And Be The BEST You Can Be" with Marcus Rashford.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Alon and Carl talk all about Manchester United. There’s Ronaldo and how he fits into the team, Ole and what he’s up to, the direction of Manchester United, Sancho, Varane, Manchester United’s “window to win”, Business Casual, Unserious, DDG vs. Henderson, writing a book with Marcus Rashford, Carl’s FPL team, and more.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
 &lt;li&gt;You can find "You Are A Champion: Unlock Your Potential, Find Your Voice And Be The BEST You Can Be" by Marcus Rashford and Carl Anka at: &lt;a href="https://www.panmacmillan.com/authors/marcus-rashford/you-are-a-champion/9781529068177" rel="noreferrer nofollow noopener" target="_blank"&gt;https://www.panmacmillan.com/authors/marcus-rashford/you-are-a-champion/9781529068177&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
