  &lt;li&gt;Check out his writing at The Athletic and get 33% off if you use this URL: &lt;a href="https://theathletic.com/manunitedpod" rel="noreferrer nofollow noopener" target="_blank"&gt;https://theathletic.com/manunitedpod&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
  &lt;li&gt;Talk of the Devils podcast: &lt;a href="https://theathletic.com/podcast/162-talk-of-the-devils/" rel="noreferrer nofollow noopener" target="_blank"&gt;https://theathletic.com/podcast/162-talk-of-the-devils/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
  &lt;li&gt;And the Wrighty’s House podcast appears in the Ringer FC feed: &lt;a href="https://open.spotify.com/show/36Ynwdxjd1TC0Z2OLFtnIm" rel="noreferrer nofollow noopener" target="_blank"&gt;https://open.spotify.com/show/36Ynwdxjd1TC0Z2OLFtnIm&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
