      <content:encoded>
        <![CDATA[<p>Questions into topics into rants and tangents and rinse and repeat. It’s time for GW1 and there are infinite possibilities ahead of us. Let’s explore some.</p>
<ul>
 <li>00:00 - Intro / admin.</li>
 <li>03:16 - Are we still on Bachmann?</li>
  <li>04:34 - Building for long term or building for short term or a bit of both?</li>
  <li>09:08 - Early Wildcard?</li>
  <li>11:41 - Liverpool / Jota / Tsimikas.</li>
  <li>24:21 - Amartey (and other 4.0 guys).</li>
  <li>29:46 - Up to forwards.</li>
  <li>30:22 - Ings / Villa.</li>
  <li>36:25 - Lukaku. Vardy?</li>
  <li>39:38 - Wilf.</li>
  <li>43:10 - Antonio and West Ham.</li>
  <li>51:43 - Leeds assets.</li>
  <li>57:54 - Man. United assets.</li>
  <li>01:04:42 - Discord questions.</li>
  <li>01:08:02 - Gundo and some City guys.</li>
  <li>01:35:11 - Captain for GW1.</li>
  <li>01:36:59 - Questions we still have for ourselves.</li>
  <li>01:39:58 - Anus slap(s) and outro.</li>
</ul>
<p>Links:</p>
<ul>
