      <description>We basically haven’t talked in a week and we’re just in it man. We are totally freestyling the episode no tactics just vibes. Lots of tangents and random thoughts here and there with days of more research and tinkering to come before finalizing our MD1 Euro Fantasy teams.

Patreon pod (2/2) recording Thursday night.

Also join our Fantasy Euros League!!! Code: 58OPBSKD08 Or just click here: https://gaming.uefa.com/en/uefaeuro2020fantasyfootball/leagues/58OPBSKD08/0046004D004C002000460050004C/FML%20FPL


