      <content:encoded>
        <![CDATA[<p>We cover a ton of topics and also do lots of ranting and tangenting and projecting and moaning. It’s sorta all over the place but hey this season was a shit-show and Walsh had his second worst season ever and Alon had his worst season ever so it should be all over the place, right? Let’s go.</p>
