      <description>Kind of a sloppy return to match day fitness from Alon after a 2+ week European absence followed by illness but alas he's back. The boys are trying to consider zigging while the rest are zagging but really they're with the rest of you lot; a little bit lost. Despite that, green arrows abound, so it's time to forge forwards... Check us out at http://fmlfpl.com || support us at http://patreon.com/FMLFPL || join our Fantasy Premier League league - 55963-25763 || we're on twatter @FMLFPL #FPL
