      <description>With our first double and big blank gameweeks of the season in the rearview mirror we can look forward to just TEN GWs left! We have to figure out the best time to use our Wildcards, Bench Boosts, and how many hits is too many hits? Many doubles and titfests to come! Check us out at http://fmlfpl.com || join our #FPL league - 41057-15509 || we're on twatter @FMLFPL || email us questions fmlfpl@gmail || rate/review/subscribe on iTunes || like on Facebook and cheers!
