    <item>
      <title>Ep. 80 - On to GW25 with A Lotta Action</title>
      <link>https://podcasters.spotify.com/pod/show/fmlfpl/episodes/Ep--80---On-to-GW25-with-A-Lotta-Action-effdnm</link>
      <description>Wow, wow, lotta action, lotta action. A lot. Of. Action. Here we are now, entertain us, GW25 incoming what new disasters can we expect? A super high scoring week set us back more double digit thousands of places but at this point what can we do? We have to keep going so we will forge forward. Ever tried. Ever failed. No matter. Try again. Fail again. Fail better. Join us... Check us out at http://fmlfpl.com || join our #FPL league - 41057-15509 || we're on twatter @FMLFPL || email us questions fmlfpl@gmail || rate/review/subscribe on iTunes || like on Facebook and cheers!
