    <item>
      <title>Ep. 79 - On to GW24 with Two Lads Leaving @ Different Times &amp; Traveling in Opposite Directions</title>
      <link>https://podcasters.spotify.com/pod/show/fmlfpl/episodes/Ep--79---On-to-GW24-with-Two-Lads-Leaving--Different-Times--Traveling-in-Opposite-Directions-effdnu</link>
      <description>A weird crappy gameweek and your two hosts bookend the point totals. Walsh picks up an unfamiliar green arrow to bring him back to respectability as Alon's house lights on fire (this is fine) and plummets back down (this is fine) all the way passed all three of the consecutive green arrows combined. Lots to talk about in a kind of scattered all over the place late night midweek fuckfest. So here we go... Check us out at http://fmlfpl.com || join our #FPL league - 41057-15509 || we're on twatter @FMLFPL || email us questions fmlfpl@gmail || rate/review/subscribe on iTunes || like on Facebook and cheers!
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
