      <description>We're basically a couple of lab rats trying to find our way through the labyrinth of FPL and you all, our faithful listeners, are the observers. Well we keep fucking running into walls is what I'm trying to get at in that metaphor. But this week we manage to cover all of the weekend and look ahead to GW23, let's do it. Check us out at http://fmlfpl.com || join our #FPL league - 41057-15509 || we're on twatter @FMLFPL || email us questions fmlfpl@gmail || rate/review/subscribe on iTunes || like on Facebook and cheers!
