      <itunes:subtitle>A couple greens in order as your hosts Alon and Walsh start to turn the corner and put some good teams together with transfers and differentials coming off for us for what seems like the first time all season.. Spurs stole the GW21 show but in the end patience is the name of the game and we're hopeful that our lads are fit for GW22 and we can keep firing (and saving transfers). Let's kick on.. Check us out at http://fmlfpl.com || join our #FPL league - 41057-15509 || we're on twatter @FMLFPL || email us questions fmlfpl@gmail || rate/review/subscribe on iTunes || like on Facebook and cheers!
