    <item>
      <title>Ep. 76 - On to GW21 with Poor Sense of Direction</title>
      <link>https://podcasters.spotify.com/pod/show/fmlfpl/episodes/Ep--76---On-to-GW21-with-Poor-Sense-of-Direction-effdn1</link>
      <description>First of all Happy New Year! Secondly fuck us; fuck all of us. We're both still in the same rut that we left 2016 with. It's been a long and welcomed, albeit disorientating, time-off from FPL but it's time to come back down to earth and get in the groove. We go macro and talk about all of the biggest points to kick off the second half of the season and try to figure shit out... Check us out at http://fmlfpl.com || join our #FPL league - 41057-15509 || we're on twatter @FMLFPL || email us questions fmlfpl@gmail || rate/review/subscribe on iTunes || like on Facebook and cheers!
