    <item>
      <title>Ep. 75 - On to GW19 and GW20 with A Taste of Green</title>
      <link>https://podcasters.spotify.com/pod/show/fmlfpl/episodes/Ep--75---On-to-GW19-and-GW20-with-A-Taste-of-Green-effdjj</link>
      <description>Last pod of 2016! Santa Claus AKA Toby Alderweireld diarrhea'd and threw up green arrows for us in a hectic set of Boxing Day fixtures so we're pleased. A lot of team structure and looking ahead to an absolutely ludicrous GW19/GW20 schedule where there are 0 days off between the GWs and most teams in the league have only one day off between their matches. We'll see what happens but we expect a bloodbath. Let's prep... Check us out at http://fmlfpl.com || join our #FPL league - 41057-15509 || we're on twatter @FMLFPL || email us questions fmlfpl@gmail || rate/review/subscribe on iTunes || like on Facebook and cheers!
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
