    <item>
      <title>Ep. 74 - On to GW18 with Gun Not Stressball</title>
      <link>https://podcasters.spotify.com/pod/show/fmlfpl/episodes/Ep--74---On-to-GW18-with-Gun-Not-Stressball-effdph</link>
      <description>The sadness feels perpetual in this moment. The red arrows go for as far as the eye can see... Walsh asks, "What does a green arrow look like? What does a green arrow feel like?" And who knows? We surely don't. But, alas, we put our rally caps on and try to spin things positively to get thru the rest of the week until more FPL. Hopefully FPL bringing treats this time around... Check us out at fmlfpl.com || join our #FPL league - 41057-15509 || we're on twatter @FMLFPL || email us questions fmlfpl@gmail || rate us on iTunes || like on Facebook and cheers!
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
