    <item>
      <title>Ep. 73 - On To GW17 with Blanks &amp; Red Arrows Galore</title>
      <link>https://podcasters.spotify.com/pod/show/fmlfpl/episodes/Ep--73---On-To-GW17-with-Blanks--Red-Arrows-Galore-effdpp</link>
      <description>We're sinking and we're sinking fast. Alon hits his lowest overall rank since GW6 and Walsh hits his lowest since GW7... At least we ride together / die together. It's been brutal though. We're picking the wrong guys and we have to look at ourselves in the mirror. Are we being too passive? Too conservative? Wrong team structure? It's a philosophical pod as we strive to find our stupid fucking feet. Check us out at fmlfpl.com || join our #FPL league - 41057-15509 || we're on twatter @FMLFPL || email us questions fmlfpl@gmail || rate us on iTunes || like on Facebook and cheers!
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
