    <item>
      <title>Ep. 72 - On To GW16 with Point Hits From Hell</title>
      <link>https://podcasters.spotify.com/pod/show/fmlfpl/episodes/Ep--72---On-To-GW16-with-Point-Hits-From-Hell-effdl7</link>
      <description>You either die with a 5 digit rank or live long enough to see yourself become a casual. Listen, it didn't come off for us this week and the mood is... gloomy. But we get in there, we cover the major happenings, we look ahead, and mistakes were made but we try to dissuade you all from making the same errors that we've made. Another pod coming midweek Wednesday night after the midweek GW and we go from there. Tag along. Check us out at fmlfpl.com || join our #FPL league - 41057-15509 || we're on twatter @FMLFPL || email us questions fmlfpl@gmail || rate us on iTunes || like on Facebook and cheers!
