    <item>
      <title>Ep. 70 - On to GW14 with Kane and Kun and Costa and Zlatan Oh My!</title>
      <link>https://podcasters.spotify.com/pod/show/fmlfpl/episodes/Ep--70---On-to-GW14-with-Kane-and-Kun-and-Costa-and-Zlatan-Oh-My-effdlj</link>
      <description>So many big hitters and so little time. And so little funds... We collectively as a community have to deal with our fallen friend Philippe the little magician and move on. We have to get Kane. We have to get Kun. We have to get Diego. We have to get Zlatan. And Alexis. And Chelsea defenders, but also Totty defenders. And Cedric. Wait holy fuck there are SO MANY GOOD GUYS AND NO TEMPLATE! THIS SEASON IS WEIRD BUT FUN!!!!!! Ok check us out at fmlfpl.com || join our #FPL league - 41057-15509 || we're on twatter @FMLFPL || email us questions fmlfpl@gmail || rate us on iTunes || like on Facebook and cheers!
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
