      <link>https://podcasters.spotify.com/pod/show/fmlfpl/episodes/Ep--67---Fireside-Chat-with-Petra-Cortright-effdqd</link>
      <description>Fireside Chat with internet artist and "soccer freak" Petra Cortright! We're taking the week off from normal Fantasy Premier League duties because of ANOTHER international break (we'll be back to normal early next week) so instead we invited our friend Petra on to talk about her history with soccer, the prem, USA soccer, women's soccer, and more! P.S. - We're allowed to call it soccer bc we're both American. - Follow Petra on twitter @petcortright and Google her name here: http://bfy.tw/8dFx || Check us out at fmlfpl.com || join our #FPL league - 41057-15509 || we're on twatter @FMLFPL || email us questions fmlfpl@gmail || rate us on iTunes || like on Facebook and cheers!
