      <title>Ep. 66 - On To GW11 with Cheapies in Midfield</title>
      <link>https://podcasters.spotify.com/pod/show/fmlfpl/episodes/Ep--66---On-To-GW11-with-Cheapies-in-Midfield-effdmh</link>
      <description>Mids mids mids mids mids. We're blowing up the midfield. Is FEO no longer our lord and savior? Is Wee Joe real? Is Gundogan God? The strike force seems a known entity, captains are already written, so we go elsewhere and dive deep. And with ANOTHER international break on the horizon we brace ourselves for the melancholy and infinite sadness and try to just have fun out there. Join us. Check us out at fmlfpl.com || join our #FPL league - 41057-15509 || we're on twatter @FMLFPL || email us questions fmlfpl@gmail || rate us on iTunes || like on Facebook and cheers!
