      <link>https://podcasters.spotify.com/pod/show/fmlfpl/episodes/Ep--65---On-to-GW10-with-Aguero-Trepidation-effdq6</link>
      <description>Things keep kind of going as planned which means we should be scared right? Something will surely screw us over in the coming weeks? I don't know. We still can't nail down a captain and we're unsure of the league's most sure thing in Kun Aguero but our teams are good. The post-wildcard era has been sweet to us as green arrows keep blooming so we'll keep rolling. Laissez les bons temps rouler. Check us out at fmlfpl.com || join our #FPL league - 41057-15509 || we're on twatter @FMLFPL || email us questions fmlfpl@gmail || rate us on iTunes || like on Facebook and cheers!
