      <title>Ep. 49 - Patiently Waiting</title>
      <link>https://podcasters.spotify.com/pod/show/fmlfpl/episodes/Ep--49---Patiently-Waiting-effdlv</link>
      <description>It's the final match for UEFA Euro Fantasy 2016 and we do our part to converse and figure out a strategy, only to then ignore it and fuck ourselves over... Shit... But yes France v Portugal will be amazing, and even more amazing is FPL (Fantasy Premier League) is coming very soon. We can hardly wait. This is a nice 'n' tidy episode with very little to talk about. We make the best of it :)
