      <description>As the player pool diminishes our enthusiasm kind of goes with it. The matches have been fantastic but Fantasy Euros just doesn't give us the same feels as a full season of Fantasy Premier League which is now around the corner. Hence only 'Semi Al Dente'... We make some picks for the semis and try and navigate the gridlock to find some potential differentials and clean sheets, if there are any at this point!
