      <description>The round of 16 didn't bring us any glory but it's ok because we have ANOTHER WILDCARD TO TIT THE QUARTERS WITH!!! Yes folks. We cover what's happening, who we like and hate and all the rest, while also going through tinker town putting together our 15-man holy grail squadron that will carry us into the clouds. Only eight teams left to choose from... You must choose, but choose wisely.... for as the true grail will give you life, the false life will take it from you....
