      <link>https://podcasters.spotify.com/pod/show/fmlfpl/episodes/Ep--44---Banter-Buffet-effdmo</link>
      <description>The week isn't even fucking over yet and we're fully diving into the UEFA Euro 2016 Fantasy Fuckfest. This is a wild uproar of the full emotional spectrum featuring love, hate, commitment, desire, disgust, and more. We close our eyes and try to recount all of what the fuck happened in an incredible first week of Euro matches, plan ahead to Gameweek 2 ("Matchday 2") with our picks for captains/cleans, and find all of the pockets and acres of space.
