      <description>We've lulled long enough. Euros are here and fantasy is back. This episode feels like a hunkering down; two men finding shelter in a squall. Our 15-man UEFA Euro Fantasy squad is rounding up, our team structure and money allocation feel safe, and we're still having fun. You gotta have fucking fun. Now let's score some points and soar into ecstasy together. *Don't forget* to join our Euro Fantasy league ASAP! League info: fmlfpl.com/leagues
