      <description>The Fantasy Premier League season finalé pod is a deep pool of reflection where we try and pick out important lessons learned from the '15/'16 season of FPL and take it from there. We have some laughs, some good memories, some shit memories - so life goes. After this ep. will come a 2-3 week hiatus before we kick off with FML FEL - our #EuroFantasy / #FantasyEuro podcast. Check http://fmlfpl.com/ for league info and much much more!
