    <item>
      <title>Ep. 39 - Double Your Pleasure, Double Your Fuckfest</title>
      <link>https://podcasters.spotify.com/pod/show/fmlfpl/episodes/Ep--39---Double-Your-Pleasure--Double-Your-Fuckfest-effdjr</link>
      <description>Zooooooom forward to the double gameweeks of GW37! We do a quick run down of WTF happened in GW36 but in reality - not much. Looking ahead to GW37 we talk about a myriad of midfielders and other doublers we'd like to transfer in, and maybe even captain. This pod is mostly about rounding out our teams for the stretch run and hopefully we cover a lot of your questions along the way. Join the FML FPL league (ID: 177490-742547), email us your questions, suggestions, or whatever else at fmlfpl@gmail.com and tweet us @FMLFPL for all Fantasy Premier League needs/banter.
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
