    <item>
      <title>Ep. 38 - Do Ducks Have Feet</title>
      <link>https://podcasters.spotify.com/pod/show/fmlfpl/episodes/Ep--38---Do-Ducks-Have-Feet-effdit</link>
      <description>A weird sad week of footy gives us a weird sad pod. We languish in the FPL scenes or lack thereof this week, but must look forward. And look forward we do, to the doubles, to the potential gains, and spend a LOT of time on the transfers. Who to bring in, who to avoid, who the fuck knows? We do our best to bring clarity to the end of the season confusion. Join the FML FPL league (ID: 177490-742547), email us your questions, suggestions, or whatever else at fmlfpl@gmail.com and tweet us @FMLFPL for all Fantasy Premier League needs/banter.
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
      <pubDate>Tue, 26 Apr 2016 05:38:03 -0000</pubDate>
