    <item>
      <title>Ep. 36 - Never Look Back</title>
      <link>https://podcasters.spotify.com/pod/show/fmlfpl/episodes/Ep--36---Never-Look-Back-effdkp</link>
      <description>This week we keep the pod compact and split it into two as only half the gameweek is through. We go over some bothers, some rotation nightmares, and a little bit of philosophy. In the end we must keep positive in the hope for bright sunshiny days ahead in the rest of GW34. And we'll pod again on Thursday night to recap the rest of the week and cover captains, cleans, and transfers for GW35. Join the FML FPL league (ID: 177490-742547), email us your questions, suggestions, or whatever else at fmlfpl@gmail.com and tweet us @FMLFPL for all Fantasy Premier League needs/banter.
