    <item>
      <title>Ep. 35 - Musings From The Void</title>
      <link>https://podcasters.spotify.com/pod/show/fmlfpl/episodes/Ep--35---Musings-From-The-Void-effdom</link>
      <description>Walsh returns only to a pod full of ramblings and nonsense and anarchy. We only graze over GW33 with our sights locked onto the double gameweek fuck-fest that is gameweek 34. We cover our teams, what moves to make or not make, and how we feel. It's a weird pod recorded at a weird time in the midst of the weirdest FPL gameweek in FPL history. Bare with us faithful listeners :). Join our league (ID: 177490-742547), mail us your questions, suggestions, or whatever else at fmlfpl@gmail.com and tweet us @FMLFPL for all Fantasy Premier League needs/banter.
