    <item>
      <title>Ep. 34 - Spanish Web</title>
      <link>https://podcasters.spotify.com/pod/show/fmlfpl/episodes/Ep--34---Spanish-Web-effdon</link>
      <description>A rare IRL FML FPL! Live coming at you from downtown New York featuring Producer Nate (and his studio) and special guest Jason in Walsh's absence. Missing the Yang to my Yin the pod still must go on as we go full penetration raw dog into the rapidly upcoming double gameweeks, blank gameweeks, and wildcard bonanzas. It's an epic, but we think it's worth it. Join us as we try and untangle the mystical Spanish Web. Don't forget to join our league ID: 177490-742547 - we hope to see you there. Mail us your RMTs and questions at fmlfpl@gmail.com and twit us @fmlfpl for all Fantasy Premier League needs/banter.
