    <item>
      <title>Ep. 32 - Rash Challenge</title>
      <link>https://podcasters.spotify.com/pod/show/fmlfpl/episodes/Ep--32---Rash-Challenge-effdla</link>
      <description>Welcome to the bonus pod! It is week one of yet another mundane international break, so let's have some fun. We recap GW31...sort of...and go off on some Pokemon related tangents. But don't fear, listener, one of your hosts is on Wildcard...so we inevitably talk about what you care about: DGW planning. We spin our wheels and discuss all things DGW as that is really what is on our minds as always. This is a fantasy footy pod, after all. We will be back with you next week to properly discuss GW32, but until then, we hope this tides you over. Don't forget to join our league ID: 177490-742547 - we hope to see you there. Mail us your RMTs and questions at fmlfpl@gmail.com and twit us @fmlfpl for all Fantasy Premier League needs/banter.
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
