    <item>
      <title>Ep. 31 - Double Gameweeks &amp; Blank Gameweeks &amp; Wildcard Bench Boosts, Oh My!</title>
      <link>https://podcasters.spotify.com/pod/show/fmlfpl/episodes/Ep--31---Double-Gameweeks--Blank-Gameweeks--Wildcard-Bench-Boosts--Oh-My-effdot</link>
      <description>The double gameweeks are finally announced and we sink our teeth into'em. We also of course cover GW30 green with envy over Kane captainers, but still on the rise. Casuals continue to falter and the FPL hardcores keep grinding. Join us for a high pace, high volume episode of projecting a month ahead to GW34 because... it's really fun to. Don't forget to join our league ID: 177490-742547 - we hope to see you there. Mail us your RMTs and questions at fmlfpl@gmail.com and twit us @fmlfpl for all Fantasy Premier League needs/banter.
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
      <pubDate>Wed, 16 Mar 2016 06:13:31 -0000</pubDate>
      <itunes:episodeType>full</itunes:episodeType>
