      <description>It feels like Easter this week because the socialist Jew has returned. Ozil blanks and everyone else dongs as your hosts soar through the ranks. We're as upbeat as ever this pod as we fully dive into everything GW29 and preview the upcoming GW30. With a minefield of blanks to tip-toe around and double gameweeks to prepare for we're finally turning a corner. Join us - we're actually happy for once. Don't forget to join our league ID: 177490-742547 - we hope to see you there. Mail us your RMTs and questions at fmlfpl@gmail.com and twit us @fmlfpl for all Fantasy Premier League needs/banter.
