      <title>Ep. 28 - Try As You Might</title>
      <link>https://podcasters.spotify.com/pod/show/fmlfpl/episodes/Ep--28---Try-As-You-Might-effdod</link>
      <description>A special Producer Nate edition of FML FPL where we delve into all things FA and Champions in this FPL off week. What do the results mean? A lot and a little. Both, at the same time. And yes, it's that time of year again - blank gameweeks, double gameweeks, oh my - we give you the low down on how to plan, or rather, if you even really need to plan. The weekend is upon us, so come join us for some banter and some fantasy chatter. Don't forget to join our league ID: 177490-742547 - we hope to see you there. Mail us your RMTs and questions at fmlfpl@gmail.com and twit us @fmlfpl for all Fantasy Premier League needs/banter.
