      <description>I don't need a weatherman to know which way the wind blows. Walsh and Costa and Payet soar but Alon and his motley crew falter. Ozil propels arsenal and screws us both over, but what else is new? We discuss the top 4 clash and the rest of the gameweek 26 FPL happenings. Join us. Don't forget to join our league ID: 177490-742547 - we hope to see you there. Mail us your RMTs and questions at fmlfpl@gmail.com and twit us @fmlfpl for all Fantasy Premier League needs/banter.
