    <item>
      <title>Ep. 26 - Buffalo Ings...</title>
      <link>https://podcasters.spotify.com/pod/show/fmlfpl/episodes/Ep--26---Buffalo-Ings-effdpe</link>
      <description>Template v1.0 strikes again with the usual suspects Algerian Messi and German Praying Mantis with double digit hauls and just like that they are back in our good graces. Have we just been trying to be too cute and too clever this season? Our ranks say yes, our hearts and minds say fuck off. Leicester fly, City stumble, Spurs look unstoppable, and Arsenal show some old signs of life. Come hang with us, listeners, for another episode of FML FPL. Don't forget to join our league ID: 177490-742547 - we hope to see you there. Mail us your RMTs and questions at fmlfpl@gmail.com and twit us @fmlfpl for all Fantasy Premier League needs/banter.
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
