      <description>The games are coming 2 fast 2 furious as your hosts give a think towards pulling off their best potential Paul Walker impersonation and maybe sorta kinda could do with a drive off a cliff. Fpl is getting the best of us lads, but that won't stop us from giving the people what they want. We love you all listeners, so sit back and enjoy our humble little pod as we look towards the new year. Don't forget to join our league ID: 177490-742547 - we hope to see you there. Mail us your RMTs at fmlfpl@gmail.com and twit us @fmlfpl for all Fantasy Premier League needs.
