      <description>The most bizarre of EPL seasons gives us the stalest of FPL ones. Bandwagons and template teams are ripe, but where can we makeup ground? Is our team the same as it ever was...? We turn philosophical this episode and then try to logicize our way out of it. Join us as Gameweek 18 and 19 loom large. Don't forget to join our league ID: 177490-742547 - we hope to see you there. Mail us your RMTs at fmlfpl@gmail.com and twit us @fmlfpl for all Fantasy Premier League needs.
