    <item>
      <title>Ep. 10 - Pacey and Pasty</title>
      <link>https://podcasters.spotify.com/pod/show/fmlfpl/episodes/Ep--10---Pacey-and-Pasty-effdrp</link>
      <description>Welp, Alexis finally woke up while Aguero remained in his season long coma as GW7 came to a close. A weekend blighted by that Cherry, Callum Wilson, crumbling to the pitch in agony like a bag of bones has many a fantasy manager scrambling for a replacement. We get into it all, including a special Walsh Wildcard bonanza, and preview GW8 in this week's episode. We will be back with you in two weeks as international break continues to wreck havoc on our happiness. Don't forget to join our league ID: 177490-742547 - we hope to see you there. Mail us your RMTs at fmlfpl@gmail.com and don't forget to twit us @fmlfpl for all Fantasy Premier League needs.
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
