      <itunes:image href="https://megaphone.imgix.net/podcasts/5ba17184-15c6-11ee-a1ba-bb93713c0948/image/20ea1f2b18e0eae9.png?ixlib=rails-4.3.1&amp;max-w=3000&amp;max-h=3000&amp;fit=crop&amp;auto=format,compress"/>
      <itunes:subtitle>It's all Martial all the time on this edition of FML FPL as we discuss the comings and goings of GW6 and preview GW7. Costa gets ready to post up next to Ibramovich as they duel it out for worst dressed in the Chelsea stands over their next couple and we get into City's stunning loss to Wenger's chain smoking mate and brother from another Eastern European mother, Slavan Bilic. It's all here, and more, in this episode of FML FPL. Don't forget to join our league ID: 177490-742547 - we hope to see you there. Mail us your RMTs at fmlfpl@gmail.com and don't forget to twit us @fmlfpl for all Fantasy Premier League needs.
