    <item>
      <title>Ep. 8 - Good Players Suck</title>
      <link>https://podcasters.spotify.com/pod/show/fmlfpl/episodes/Ep--8---Good-Players-Suck-effdr2</link>
      <description>GW5 is in the books and we keep at it in trying to unpack this tumultuous season. The budgetary options continue to fire while the premiums keep blanking...woe is us. It seems like you either pick your clean sheets correct or end up with a big red arrow. We get stuck in looking forward towards GW6 in a hope to finally hit on captaincy to propel us through the rankings. Don't forget to join our league ID: 177490-742547 - we hope to see you there. Mail us your RMTs at fmlfpl@gmail.com and don't forget to twit us @fmlfpl for all Fantasy Premier League needs.
