    <item>
      <title>Ep. 7 - We Are Back</title>
      <link>https://podcasters.spotify.com/pod/show/fmlfpl/episodes/Ep--7---We-Are-Back-effdqj</link>
      <description>As we watch the first international break die a slow and excruciating death your hosts turn their attentions towards Gameweek 5. In what seems like decades ago, we recap the action from GW4 and cry a little into our beers for yet another Aguero captaincy blank and a couple of low scores. But, we try to keep our youthful, yank perkiness and optimism as we look forward! We cover the usual RMT, get into what the fuck happened last week, and then wrap up with GW5 captaincy, clean sheets, and finally a quick review of our teams. Don't forget to join our league ID: 177490-742547 - we hope to see you there. Mail us your RMTs at fmlfpl@gmail.com and don't forget to twit us @fmlfpl for all Fantasy Premier League needs.
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
