      <description>Ahead of the saddest time of all - an international break - we hit on our usual agenda while also adding a new segment called 'what the fuck happened last week' where we cover salient FPL talking points as we see them from the weekend. In your hosts' constant effort to improve the pod we took some listener suggestions...we shortened the user submitted RMT section and worked on saying "like" less! Don't forget to join our league ID: 177490-742547 - we hope to see you there. Mail us your RMTs at fmlfpl@gmail.com and don't forget to twit us @fmlfpl for all Fantasy Premier League needs.
