    <item>
      <title>Ep. 5 - Flexibility Yields Stability</title>
      <link>https://podcasters.spotify.com/pod/show/fmlfpl/episodes/Ep--5---Flexibility-Yields-Stability-effdqv</link>
      <description>Gameweek 2 has come and gone and seemingly rewarded knee jerkers as many of those GW1 scorers kept it up. Bandwagons have firmly emerged...but which of them are for real and which are flashes in the pan? We discuss this, a user submitted RMT, price changes, clean sheets, and captaincy options. Join us as we experience the emotional ebbs and flows of GW2 and how our teams are faring as well moving forward. Don't forget to join our league ID: 177490-742547 - we hope to see you there. Mail us your RMTs at fmlfpl@gmail.com and don't forget to twit us @fmlfpl for all Fantasy Premier League needs.
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
